---
description: Prisma and PostgreSQL rules for EstateX
globs: apps/api/prisma/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Database

- Prisma only. UUID primary keys. Enums for all status/type fields.
- Unique constraints: email, slug, favorite `(userId, propertyId)`, amenity name.
- Indexes follow real query patterns: city, price, propertyType, listingType, bedrooms, status, createdAt, agentId.
- Never expose `passwordHash`. Never log raw tokens.
- No destructive migrations unless the user explicitly asks.
- Public property queries filter `PUBLISHED` unless the caller is owner or admin.
